  "operative_text": "Section 2 (C.R.S. 39-37-301(2)(a)(II)): BEHAVIORAL AND MENTAL HEALTH EXCISE TAX CASH FUND CREATED IN SECTION 39-37-302; and\nSection 1 (C.R.S. 24-75-230(3.8)(a)): ON JUNE 30, 2025, THE STATE TREASURER SHALL TRANSFER ANY MONEY RECEIVED PURSUANT TO SECTION 39-37-301 (2)(a)(II) TO THE BEHAVIORAL AND MENTAL HEALTH EXCISE TAX CASH FUND CREATED IN SECTION 39-37-302.\nSection 3 (C.R.S. 39-37-302(1)(a)): THE BEHAVIORAL AND MENTAL HEALTH EXCISE TAX CASH FUND IS CREATED IN THE STATE TREASURY, REFERRED TO IN THIS SECTION AS THE \"FUND\". THE FUND CONSISTS OF MONEY TRANSFERRED TO THE FUND PURSUANT TO SECTION 39-37-301 (2)(a)(II) AND ANY OTHER MONEY THAT THE GENERAL ASSEMBLY MAY APPROPRIATE OR TRANSFER TO THE FUND."
